t.<br>Es sind auch wenige Regeln weggefallen oder unnötig geworden, weswegen wir euch bitten wollen die Regeln noch einmal vollständig zu lesen.<br>Dies sollte euch wegen der neuen, übersichtlicheren Struktur hoffentlich nicht schwer fallen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ihr könnt das neue Regelwerk im Forum und auch im Game nachlesen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mfg ViruszZ</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52950,"threadID":3938,"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","subject":"","time":1480007797,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1480008053,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1480009411,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hab sie mir grade durchgelesen. Man merkt, dass Ihr euch mühe gegeben habt. Vielen Dank an Euch.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MFG Wario the MLG guy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52951,"threadID":3938,"userID":2104,"username":"EndCockX.","subject":"","time":1480008310,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1480009422,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hat sich, danke.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52952,"threadID":3938,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1480008783,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1480009427,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>NEU &gt; Bei Verstecken sind die alle T Zonen aufgehoben</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52953,"threadID":3938,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1480008893,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2104,"username":"EndoX.","time":1480008976,"value":1},{"use